This model is a fine-tuned derivative of Qwen3.5-2B (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B,
revision 15852e8c16360a2fea060d615a32b45270f8a8fc), Copyright 2026 Alibaba Cloud, licensed under the Apache
